        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Twice a year, the Company will conduct a training workshop in order to afford interested employees the opportunity, on their own time, to gain understanding of the mechanical and clerical duties of the Service Technician Apprentice classification and some practice in taking tests.",
